# 构建上下文忽略
# 源码卷挂载模式：镜像只构建 Python 运行环境，业务代码/前端不进 context，
# 仅需 backend/config/requirements.txt；dist 由卷挂载 / rsync 提供。
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
.git/
.gitignore
node_modules/
frontend/
docs-site/node_modules/
tests/
backend/tests/
deploy/
# platform/ 整体不入构建 context，但 docs-site 镜像需独立 COPY 的最小文件集需放行
# （serve_docs.py + docs-site/dist 源码快照，见 Dockerfile.docs）
platform/*
!platform/bs-deploy/
!platform/bs-deploy/serve_docs.py
!platform/doc-deploy/
!platform/doc-deploy/docs-site/
!platform/doc-deploy/docs-site/dist/
!platform/doc-deploy/docs-site/dist/**
.github/
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.docs
docker-compose.yml
*.md
*.yml
*.yaml
generated-images/
outputs/
.DS_Store
# 保留依赖清单（供 COPY backend/config/requirements.txt）
backend/*
!backend/config
